            <title>0.4.1</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 07:51:20 -0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/siplay01/local-voice-releases</link>
            <sparkle:version>0.4.1</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.4.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Whiskers 0.4.1</h2><p>Simpler dictation: the Record menu item is gone. Hold the key for one phrase, or double-tap it for hands-free Listening. Listening now waits 1.5 seconds of silence before it pastes, so a short pause to think no longer splits a sentence. You can still change the pause in Settings.</p>
]]></description>
